flowchart TB
  EXC[Java Exception Handling]
  EXC --> HIER[Exception Hierarchy]
  HIER --> TROW[Throwable]
  TROW --> ERR[Error]
  TROW --> EXC2[Exception]
  EXC2 --> RTE[RuntimeException]
  EXC2 --> CKE[Checked Exceptions]

  EXC --> MECH[Mechanisms]
  MECH --> TCF[try / catch / finally]
  MECH --> TWR[try-with-resources]
  MECH --> THROW[throw]
  MECH --> THROWS[throws]

  EXC --> BEST[Best Practices]
  BEST --> FAIL[Fail Fast]
  BEST --> WRAP[Wrapping]
  BEST --> LOG[Logging]
  BEST --> CUST[Custom Exceptions]

  EXC --> IO[I/O Streams]
  IO --> BYTE[Byte Streams]
  IO --> CHAR[Character Streams]
  IO --> BUF[Buffered Streams]

  EXC --> NIO[NIO and NIO.2]
  NIO --> CHAN[Channels Buffers]
  NIO --> PATH[Path Files]
  NIO --> MMF[Memory-Mapped Files]

  EXC --> SER[Java Serialization]
  SER --> OBJ[ObjectOutputStream]
  SER --> SERID[serialVersionUID]
  SER --> TRANSIENT[transient]
